    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0653" n="533" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg533"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-03-17"><hi rendition="#italic">March 17,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 677.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 1657, of the 21st ultimo, reporting the use of your unofficial good offices
                    on behalf of certain Syrians whose expulsion was ordered from Haiti without a
                    sufficient time being granted them to enable them to dispose of their stocks of
                    goods.</p>
                <p>The use of your unofficial good offices in their behalf is approved.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
